1:["$","$Ld",null,{"document":{"kind":"terms","title":{"zh":"服务条款","en":"Terms of Service"},"description":{"zh":"关于使用 Kepori、保存内容以及购买 Pro 的约定。","en":"The terms for using Kepori, saving content and purchasing Pro."},"sections":[{"id":"scope","title":{"zh":"适用范围与阅读提示","en":"Scope and reading these terms"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"本文件中的“Kepori”或“我们”指 Kepori 应用及官网的服务提供者。服务咨询、隐私请求及投诉均可发送至 jinwandalaohu940@gmail.com。","en":"In this document, “Kepori”, “we” and “us” refer to the provider of the Kepori app and website. For service enquiries, privacy requests or complaints, email jinwandalaohu940@gmail.com."},{"zh":"本条款适用于 Kepori 应用和 kepori.app 官网。请在使用前阅读，尤其是购买续订、第三方内容、数据保存和责任部分。如果你无法接受相应约定，请停止使用相关服务；已经产生的退款或其他法定权利不因此受影响。隐私政策单独说明信息处理方式，本条款不替代需要另行取得的个人信息处理同意。","en":"These terms apply to the Kepori app and kepori.app. Please read them before use, especially the sections on purchases and renewal, third-party content, data storage and liability. If you cannot accept a provision, stop using the relevant service; this does not affect accrued refund or other statutory rights. The Privacy Policy separately explains information practices. These terms do not replace any separately required consent to processing personal information."},{"zh":"通过 Apple App Store 获取应用时，还适用商店中列明的软件许可及 Apple 的使用规则。在没有另行提供有效自定义许可的情况下，适用 Apple 标准最终用户许可协议。本条款补充说明 Kepori 的服务规则，不减少适用许可或强制性法律赋予你的权利。","en":"When you obtain the app through the Apple App Store, the software license shown in the store and Apple’s usage rules also apply. In the absence of a valid custom license, Apple’s Standard End User License Agreement applies. These terms supplement Kepori’s service rules and do not reduce rights under the applicable license or mandatory law."}],"links":[{"label":{"zh":"Apple 标准最终用户许可协议","en":"Apple Standard EULA"},"href":"https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/"},{"label":{"zh":"隐私政策","en":"Privacy Policy"},"href":"/privacy"}]},{"id":"service","title":{"zh":"Kepori 提供什么","en":"What Kepori provides"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"Kepori 是用于个人保存、阅读、整理和找回作品的本地优先工具。你可以主动提交公开网页链接，由 App 尝试提取可访问的文字、来源信息及允许保存的媒体，并使用空间、笔记、高亮、搜索和支持格式的导出功能。Kepori 不是原作发布平台，也不为原始作者或来源网站代言。","en":"Kepori is a local-first tool for personal saving, reading, organization and retrieval. You can submit public web links for the app to attempt extraction of accessible text, source information and media that may be saved, and use spaces, notes, highlights, search and supported export formats. Kepori is not the original publishing platform and does not represent original authors or source websites."},{"zh":"解析能力受网页结构、公开访问范围、版权许可、网络、设备空间和来源平台变化影响。不能保证所有链接或媒体都能完整保存，也不能保证失效、删除或受限的原作能够恢复。保留链接或显示保底卡片不代表已完整归档。","en":"Extraction depends on page structure, public accessibility, rights and permissions, network conditions, device storage and changes at source platforms. We cannot guarantee complete saving of every link or media item, or recovery of removed, expired or restricted originals. A retained link or fallback card does not mean a complete archive exists."}]},{"id":"eligibility","title":{"zh":"使用资格与设备","en":"Eligibility and devices"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"你应具有订立及履行相关约定所需的行为能力。未成年人应在监护人指导和适用法律允许的范围内使用，购买前取得所需授权。你负责妥善管理设备、Apple 账号及系统授权，避免未经许可的使用。","en":"You must have the legal capacity or authorization needed to enter into and perform these terms. Minors should use it with guardian guidance and as permitted by law, and obtain required authorization before purchasing. You are responsible for managing your device, Apple account and system permissions to prevent unauthorized use."},{"zh":"应用需要兼容的 Apple 设备和系统版本。来源请求、媒体下载和商店操作可能消耗网络流量并产生运营商费用；保存媒体和生成搜索索引会占用设备空间。","en":"The app requires a compatible Apple device and operating-system version. Source requests, media downloads and store operations may consume data and incur carrier charges. Saved media and search indexes use device storage."}]},{"id":"content","title":{"zh":"作品来源、版权与合理使用","en":"Sources, copyright and permitted use"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"原始作品、媒体、作者信息和第三方商标的权利归相应权利人。公开可访问并不意味着你可以不受限制地复制、下载、传播或商业使用。你应确保提交、保存、导出和分享内容具有适用法律、许可或权利人授权的依据，并遵守来源服务的有效规则。","en":"Rights in original works, media, author information and third-party marks belong to their respective holders. Public accessibility does not grant unrestricted copying, downloading, distribution or commercial-use rights. You must have a basis under applicable law, license or right-holder permission for submitting, saving, exporting or sharing content and comply with valid source-service rules."},{"zh":"请保留适用的作者署名、来源链接、水印和版权标识。Kepori 的阅读整理不转移作品权利，也不向你授予第三方内容的再发布许可。你创建的笔记和整理信息不会因为使用 Kepori 而转让给我们；为执行你选择的本机操作，App 仅进行相应的处理。","en":"Preserve applicable attribution, source links, watermarks and copyright notices. Kepori’s reading and organization features do not transfer ownership or grant republication rights in third-party content. Your notes and organization data are not transferred to us by using Kepori; the app processes them as needed for the local actions you choose."},{"zh":"不得利用 Kepori 侵犯他人隐私或知识产权，绕过登录、付费墙、验证码、DRM 或其他访问控制，规避限流，传播违法内容，干扰服务安全，或实施未经授权的批量抓取。","en":"Do not use Kepori to infringe privacy or intellectual-property rights, bypass logins, paywalls, CAPTCHAs, DRM or other access controls, evade rate limits, distribute unlawful content, interfere with service security or conduct unauthorized bulk scraping."}]},{"id":"pro","title":{"zh":"免费使用与 Kepori Pro","en":"Free use and Kepori Pro"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"当前免费版允许在本机保存最多 10 件有效收藏；已接受并处理中的新增保存会占用名额，同一作品在多个空间中不重复计数。删除可释放名额，恢复回收站内容时会重新检查额度。Pro 在有效期间解除该收藏数量限制，本地智能搜索不单独收费。","en":"The current free version allows up to 10 active saved items on the device. Accepted new saves in progress reserve a slot; the same item in multiple spaces is not counted twice. Deletion can free a slot, and restoring from trash checks the limit again. Active Pro removes this collection-count limit. On-device intelligent search is not charged separately."},{"zh":"Pro 提供月度、年度自动续订订阅及一次性购买的终身方案，是否可购买、实际价格、币种、税费及权益以你所在地区的 App Store 商品和购买确认页面为准。商品尚未上架或无法读取时，不构成可以购买的要约。我们不在本条款中固定可能随地区或商店配置变化的价格。","en":"Pro offers monthly and annual auto-renewing subscriptions and a lifetime one-time purchase. Availability, price, currency, taxes and included benefits are those shown by the App Store in your region and on the purchase-confirmation screen. A product that is not listed or cannot be loaded is not an offer available for purchase. These terms do not fix prices that may vary by region or store configuration."},{"zh":"“终身”指通过一次性购买取得对应 Pro 功能的非消耗型使用权益，不是云端存储、云端 AI 额度或保证无限期提供所有未来服务的承诺。未来独立收费的新产品或服务是否包含，应在推出时明确说明，不能据此追溯取消你已购买的权益。","en":"“Lifetime” means a non-consumable entitlement to the corresponding Pro features purchased once. It is not a promise of cloud storage, cloud AI credits or indefinite provision of every future service. Whether separately priced future products or services are included will be stated when offered; this provision does not retrospectively cancel purchased entitlements."}]},{"id":"ai-points","title":{"zh":"AI 解读与点数","en":"AI interpretation and points"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"官方云端 AI 是可选服务，需要联网并按确认页面显示的点数消耗使用。AI 点数通过 Apple 内购单独购买，与 Pro 收藏权益分开；月度、年度或终身 Pro 均不代表无限 AI。点数不是现金，不可提现或转让，也不会因停止 Pro 订阅而自动转换为其他权益。","en":"Online AI is optional, requires a connection and uses the number of points shown before confirmation. AI points are purchased separately through Apple in-app purchases and are separate from Pro collection benefits. Monthly, annual and lifetime Pro do not include unlimited AI. Points are not cash, cannot be withdrawn or transferred and do not convert into another benefit when Pro ends."},{"zh":"价格、点数包数量及可用性以购买确认页面为准；提交前请查看当前任务费用。系统通过服务端余额与交易记录结算，重复请求不会重复计费；生成失败时执行应有退款，网络或上游故障可能延迟余额更新。AI 点数包属于消耗型内购，剩余额度通过同一购买身份的服务端余额恢复，不以普通“恢复购买”重发已消耗的点数。购买退款通过 Apple 申请。","en":"Prices, pack sizes and availability are shown on the purchase-confirmation screen. Review each task’s point cost before submitting. Server balances and transaction records determine settlement; repeated requests do not incur duplicate charges. Failed generation triggers the applicable point refund, although network or upstream failures may delay balance updates. Point packs are consumable purchases. Remaining balances are retrieved for the same purchasing identity; ordinary Restore Purchases does not reissue spent points. Request purchase refunds through Apple."},{"zh":"AI 输出可能遗漏、误解或生成不准确内容，引用来源不保证结论正确。请结合原文判断，不能将结果作为专业医疗、法律或财务建议。使用自行配置的 AI 服务时，费用及服务规则由对应服务商另行约定。数据处理与结果保留详见隐私政策。","en":"AI responses may omit, misunderstand or invent information. Source citations do not guarantee a correct conclusion. Review the original and do not treat responses as professional medical, legal or financial advice. Providers you configure yourself set their own fees and service terms. See the Privacy Policy for processing and result retention."}]},{"id":"billing","title":{"zh":"续订、取消、恢复与退款","en":"Renewal, cancellation, restoration and refunds"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"付款由 Apple 处理。自动续订订阅会按商店购买页说明续订，除非你及时取消；Apple 可能在当前周期结束前开始处理续费。请在续订前通过 Apple 账号的订阅管理页面操作，并以该页面显示的时间和状态为准。删除 App 或停止使用不会自动取消订阅。","en":"Apple processes payments. Auto-renewing subscriptions renew as described on the store purchase screen unless cancelled in time; Apple may start renewal processing before the current period ends. Manage your subscription in your Apple account before renewal and rely on the dates and status shown there. Deleting the app or stopping use does not cancel a subscription."},{"zh":"通常取消续订后，已付费周期内的权益继续有效，具体以 Apple 确认的状态及适用法律为准。购买终身方案不会自动替你取消已有订阅；如不再需要，请自行在 Apple 订阅管理中取消，避免继续续费。","en":"After cancellation, access normally continues for the paid period, subject to Apple’s confirmed status and applicable law. Buying lifetime access does not automatically cancel an existing subscription. Cancel an unneeded subscription in Apple’s subscription settings to prevent further renewals."},{"zh":"更换或重新安装设备后，可使用购买时的 Apple 账号执行恢复购买。权益以 Apple 验证结果为准；购买取消、等待批准或验证失败时不会提前解锁。退款可通过 Apple 的问题报告服务申请，资格与处理结果由 Apple 按其规则及适用法律决定。我们的支持邮箱也可协助解释问题，但不能承诺替 Apple 批准退款。","en":"After changing devices or reinstalling, use the Apple account used for purchase to restore purchases. Entitlements depend on Apple verification. Cancelled, pending or unverified purchases do not unlock access early. Refunds can be requested through Apple’s Report a Problem service; Apple determines eligibility and outcomes under its rules and applicable law. Our support can help explain issues but cannot promise approval on Apple’s behalf."},{"zh":"Pro 到期或被撤销不会自动删除已有收藏；仍允许访问、编辑、搜索和导出已有内容，新增或恢复收藏重新适用免费额度。","en":"Expiration or revocation of Pro does not automatically delete existing saved items. You can continue to access, editing, search and export of existing content; adding or restoring content is again subject to the free limit."}],"links":[{"label":{"zh":"管理 Apple 订阅","en":"Manage Apple subscriptions"},"href":"https://apps.apple.com/account/subscriptions"},{"label":{"zh":"向 Apple 申请退款","en":"Request a refund from Apple"},"href":"https://reportaproblem.apple.com/"}]},{"id":"storage","title":{"zh":"数据保存与退出","en":"Storage and leaving the service"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"作品库主要保存在设备上，Kepori 不提供运营者可远程恢复的云端副本。请使用实际可用的导出功能妥善保存重要内容，并确认导出文件可以打开。单件 Markdown、HTML 或 PDF 导出与完整作品库备份恢复不是同一功能，不应把前者视为后者。","en":"The library is primarily stored on your device. Kepori does not provide a cloud copy that the operator can remotely restore. Use available export features for important content and check that exported files open correctly. Individual Markdown, HTML or PDF exports are different from complete library backup and restoration and should not be treated as equivalent."},{"zh":"你可使用作品库文件备份与恢复，并主动开启 Apple iCloud 私有数据库同步。同步依赖 Apple 账号、可用存储空间与网络，不代表独立历史备份；删除或编辑也可能同步到其他设备。关闭同步不会自动删除本地资料或已有云端副本，相关副本应分别管理。","en":"You can use library-file backup and restore and optionally enable synchronization through Apple’s private iCloud database. Sync depends on your Apple account, available storage and connectivity. It is not an independent historical backup: edits and deletions may propagate to other devices. Turning sync off does not automatically remove local data or existing cloud copies, which must be managed separately."},{"zh":"永久删除、卸载、设备丢失、损坏或系统问题可能导致本机内容丢失。回收站内容需你手动恢复或永久删除；清理缓存不等于清空作品库。应用锁不能保护你已经导出或分享至其他位置的副本。你可以停止使用和卸载 App；若有订阅，还需单独通过 Apple 取消。","en":"Permanent deletion, uninstallation, device loss or damage, or system failures may cause local-data loss. Trash items must be manually restored or permanently deleted; clearing cache is not the same as erasing the library. App lock does not protect copies already exported or shared elsewhere. You may stop use and uninstall, but any subscription must be cancelled separately through Apple."}]},{"id":"third-parties","title":{"zh":"第三方与结果准确性","en":"Third parties and accuracy"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"第三方网站、原作、网络服务和 Apple 服务由各自提供者控制，可能变更、限制或停止提供。第三方链接不表示我们认可其全部内容。解析出的标题、作者、时间和正文可能存在遗漏或错误；本地智能搜索也可能返回不相关结果。重要信息请回到原始来源核实。","en":"Third-party websites, originals, network services and Apple services are controlled by their respective providers and may change, restrict or discontinue availability. Links do not imply endorsement of all third-party content. Extracted titles, authors, dates and text may contain errors or omissions, and local intelligent search may return irrelevant results. Verify important information with the original source."},{"zh":"Kepori 不是专业医疗、法律或财务建议服务，也不对原作的合法性、准确性或持续可用性作保证。","en":"Kepori is not a professional medical, legal or financial advice service and does not guarantee the lawfulness, accuracy or continued availability of original third-party content."}]},{"id":"availability","title":{"zh":"更新与服务变化","en":"Updates and service changes"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"我们可能为修复问题、安全、兼容性或产品调整更新应用及网站。涉及付费核心权益或服务停止的重要变化，将以适当方式提前说明，并按适用法律处理已付费权益及补救；不会通过修改本条款排除不可放弃的消费者权利。紧急安全或法律原因可能需要立即限制相关功能。","en":"We may update the app and website for fixes, security, compatibility or product changes. Material changes to paid core benefits or service discontinuation will receive appropriate advance notice, with paid entitlements and remedies handled under applicable law. Changes to these terms do not remove non-waivable consumer rights. Urgent security or legal reasons may require immediate restrictions to affected features."}]},{"id":"liability","title":{"zh":"责任与法定权利","en":"Responsibility and statutory rights"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"我们会以合理注意维护 Kepori，但无法保证服务永不中断、无错误或适用于所有目的。第三方变化、网络中断或用户设备问题可能影响功能。你应合理保管重要内容，并避免仅依赖单一设备副本。","en":"We maintain Kepori with reasonable care but cannot guarantee uninterrupted, error-free operation or suitability for every purpose. Third-party changes, network interruptions or device problems may affect functionality. Keep important content appropriately and avoid relying solely on a single device copy."},{"zh":"各方按照适用法律承担责任。本条款不排除或限制因故意、重大过失、人身损害或其他依法不得排除事项产生的责任，不排除消费者依法享有的退款、修理、替换或其他救济。任何条款无效或不可执行时，其余条款在法律允许范围内继续有效。","en":"Each party remains responsible as required by applicable law. These terms do not exclude or limit liability for intentional misconduct, gross negligence, personal injury or other matters that cannot lawfully be excluded, or statutory consumer remedies such as refunds, repair or replacement. If a provision is invalid or unenforceable, the remainder continues to apply to the extent permitted by law."}]},{"id":"contact","title":{"zh":"投诉、争议与条款更新","en":"Complaints, disputes and changes"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"如对服务、购买或内容来源有疑问，请通过本页联系邮箱说明问题。版权相关请求请提供原始作品链接、相关 Kepori 官网页面（如有）、权利依据及便于回复的联系方式。App 的私人作品库不由我们集中托管，我们无法据此远程检索或清除其他用户设备上的内容。","en":"Contact the email on this page about service, purchase or source-content concerns. For copyright requests, provide the original-work link, relevant Kepori website page if any, the basis of your rights and a reply address. We do not centrally host private app libraries and cannot remotely search or clear content on other users’ devices."},{"zh":"我们优先通过沟通处理争议。你仍可依法向消费者保护机构、监管部门或有管辖权的法院寻求解决，本条款不要求强制仲裁或放弃集体、法定诉讼权利。适用法律与管辖按有约束力的法律规则确定，不以本页强制剥夺你居住地依法适用的保护。","en":"We aim to resolve disputes through communication. You may seek resolution through consumer-protection bodies, regulators or competent courts as provided by law. These terms do not mandate arbitration or waive class or statutory action rights. Applicable law and jurisdiction are determined by binding legal rules, without removing mandatory protections applicable where you live."},{"zh":"条款更新会标明日期；重大变化以适当方式通知，依法需要重新同意的将另行取得。中文和英文版本旨在表达相同约定；如有歧义，我们会澄清和更正，不因此减少你享有的强制性法律保护。","en":"Updates will carry a date. Material changes will receive appropriate notice, with renewed agreement obtained where legally required. The Chinese and English versions are intended to express the same terms. We will clarify and correct discrepancies without reducing mandatory legal protections."}]}]}}]
